menu "Badge UI"

config BADGE_FONT_LATIN1
    bool "Latin-1 (Western European) text support"
    default y
    help
        Build the UI fonts with the Latin-1 supplement (U+00A0..U+00FF) so
        accented Western European text — Icelandic, German, French, the
        Nordic languages and more — renders in messages, node names and
        the rest of the UI. Costs roughly 100 KB of flash.

        When disabled, LVGL's built-in ASCII-only Montserrat fonts are
        used and accented characters render as blanks.

endmenu
